{
"file": 30,
"paths": [
"d002/f639"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "4c0ec35e",
"en_raw": "You can see a raccoon dog at the zoo"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "bc39483d",
"en_raw": "can't you?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "c174c475",
"en_raw": "Do zoos even have raccoon dogs?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "708eec52",
"en_raw": "They do, probably"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "16a08b01",
"en_raw": "Sango has never seen a real one either"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "2dcf6759",
"en_raw": "I don't watch animal shows"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "17d6008c",
"en_raw": "Can you see a raccoon dog in this town?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "a6d7173a",
"en_raw": "Of course not"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "6fa49075",
"en_raw": "However much of a backwater Hirumi is..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "4d7440c4",
"en_raw": "Right, I thought so"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "a298207f",
"en_raw": "I mean, there might be some"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "602479f7",
"en_raw": "but if there were, yikes, in a different way"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "9218866d",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see a raccoon dog!"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "3cf95df1",
"en_raw": "Then, just in case"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "c3672f95",
"en_raw": "shall we go check?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "91b34451",
"en_raw": "Yay"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "1393f1de",
"en_raw": "But Nao, Narusawa Housing Estate"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "aff0e3db",
"en_raw": "is a murder scene, you know"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "097311ed",
"en_raw": "It's a lie, that story"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "337eb97a",
"en_raw": "I've never heard it"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "d7fd829d",
"en_raw": "Tch, I just wanted to make"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "9e4b3d6b",
"en_raw": "the story more fun..."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "63278516",
"en_raw": "Raccoon dogs are nocturnal, right?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "db8b172a",
"en_raw": "We should probably go a bit later"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "b9b0ab21",
"en_raw": "By the way, Narusawa Estate"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "6947d9a7",
"en_raw": "has nobody living there anymore, right?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "12cb67ed",
"en_raw": "Can we even get in there?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "a181dae0",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, it was"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "50c8ee22",
"en_raw": "sealed off with a fence, maybe"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "2ac3e9e8",
"en_raw": "Because it's a murder scene"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "f47b7bd6",
"en_raw": "If the road doesn't continue"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "b885702a",
"en_raw": "we can't meet Mr. Raccoon Dog"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "d1975140",
"en_raw": "Too bad"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "4497160f",
"en_raw": "Well, it can't be helped"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "db53b1fa",
"en_raw": "Because it's a murder scene"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "75a73d5a",
"en_raw": "You're still saying that"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "7dba6262",
"en_raw": "It's a lie, that fence"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "869ab7dc",
"en_raw": "wasn't there until recently"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "80eb19d3",
"en_raw": "Oh, so Nao, have you"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "341e318f",
"en_raw": "been past it?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "5e76171b",
"en_raw": "No, but..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "5cc41ffe",
"en_raw": "Maybe"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "1eb92e73",
"en_raw": "there's something at Narusawa Estate"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "128feae0",
"en_raw": "scarier than a raccoon dog"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "6b784434",
"en_raw": "a blood-soaked stage of tragedy..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "ed44f9d4",
"en_raw": "There's no way"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "8825746c",
"en_raw": "Hey Nao"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "6c4cf398",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see a raccoon dog"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "1b8959fe",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao, the fence"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "909d124f",
"en_raw": "when was it not there?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "065bf37d",
"en_raw": "Recently, I think, but I don't remember"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "66817977",
"en_raw": "They probably take it down"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "18a8cb55",
"en_raw": "when doing construction"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "98dc64d6",
"en_raw": "I see, then we could sneak in"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "c3ca1c9e",
"en_raw": "at times like that"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "a84992f7",
"en_raw": "What we're going to see"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "4e18127c",
"en_raw": "isn't a murder scene"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "ef963a52",
"en_raw": "it's raccoon dogs"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "c436a2eb",
"en_raw": "So everything I saw"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "2b61cab2",
"en_raw": "was my imagination"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "e14a78c5",
"en_raw": "or something, you're saying?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "2a78cb7a",
"en_raw": "Who knows, I don't know about that"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "bdb1b551",
"en_raw": "But the fence was actually"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "4fb3bf74",
"en_raw": "still closed"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "c3539d1d",
"en_raw": "and the murder was just my"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "5ef89cf1",
"en_raw": "harmless fantasy"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "f140610a",
"en_raw": "and a man-eater, even more so..."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "560fba01",
"en_raw": "Nao, this is Japan, you know?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "20cd3562",
"en_raw": "So even Sango is saying"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "089522b6",
"en_raw": "I was tricked by a raccoon dog"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "3fc4695e",
"en_raw": "...is that what you mean?"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "b472145b",
"en_raw": "If that happened"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "c8c3e50b",
"en_raw": "the world would be a bit more fun"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "b71ab319",
"en_raw": "Lucky Nao"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "46c8caeb",
"en_raw": "getting to meet a raccoon dog"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "5fe08467",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of Narusawa Estate"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "1ba9ecfb",
"en_raw": "Aww, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "5b41befc",
"en_raw": "wants to see a raccoon dog"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "6f18a6ea",
"en_raw": "No, definitely not"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "50a3c465",
"en_raw": "going into a place like that"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "6bd79a07",
"en_raw": "So even if I wanted to"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "ee73939e",
"en_raw": "I can't get in, I'm telling you"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "bf969d02",
"en_raw": "I went there"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "41beebb4",
"en_raw": "People live in the estate's ruins..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "712d3c0f",
"en_raw": "And a weird man..."
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "61494ffa",
"en_raw": "E-eating people..."
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "4de0a11a",
"en_raw": "Nao..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "e89a06a3",
"en_raw": "I kept quiet because I thought"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "322bac44",
"en_raw": "it concerns your dignity, but..."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "9e7fe8fa",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "a1133d79",
"en_raw": "You were just clinging to a utility pole"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "788bc8f9",
"en_raw": "on Koshu Kaido"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "64db3581",
"en_raw": "crying the whole time"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "36bddbf5",
"en_raw": "saying 'don't kill me'"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "9e0b517f",
"en_raw": "We didn't want passersby to think"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "d044b268",
"en_raw": "we were your friends, so"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "1fa0d1f8",
"en_raw": "we left you and went home"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "d57d9ffa",
"en_raw": "Right, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "6677278a",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "5fe08467",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of Narusawa Estate"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "73c9cbaf",
"en_raw": "Raccoon dogs in photos"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "fea242e1",
"en_raw": "are really cute after all"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "f0da21aa",
"en_raw": "If they're somewhere in that forest"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "f93b44da",
"en_raw": "I'd like to see one someday..."
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "ff59e6e2",
"en_raw": "I don't want to!"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}